 "steps": [
  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Simmer the dashi, soy sauce and mirin for 1 minute, then set aside as a dipping sauce (tentsuyu).</li><li>Brush or wipe the mushrooms clean and trim the tough shared base. Tear into <b>small, flat pieces of one or two caps</b>; split any thick stem lengthwise. Pat dry and avoid soaking. Do not leave a dense whole bunch.</li></ul>",
