  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Mix the cold water and beaten egg first. Add the flour and cornstarch; stir briefly with chopsticks, leaving small lumps. Keep the bowl over ice. Make the batter only when the oil is ready.</li><li>Heat oil to <b><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"temp\" data-u=\"C\" data-a=\"170\" data-s=\"0\">170 °C</span></b>. Lightly dust a few dry mushroom pieces with flour, shake off excess, dip in batter and let excess drip. Keep the thin cap edges separate.</li></ul>",
