  {
   "body_html": "<ul class=\"do\"><li>Lower a few flat pieces into the oil without overlapping.</li><li>Fry about <b>2–3 minutes</b>, turning once, until the batter is crisp and pale gold and the thickest stem join is tender.</li><li>Use the time as a guide and check a thick piece.</li><li>Skim loose crumbs and restore <b><span class=\"q\" data-k=\"temp\" data-u=\"C\" data-a=\"170\" data-s=\"0\">170 °C</span></b> between batches.</li></ul>",
